      "slug": "field-worker-tool",
      "title": "Field worker tool",
      "modules": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A tool for strawberry field worker that helps to set up metal rods in an easier more ergonomic way.\n \n The choice of a standard diameter galvanized iron pipe with a minimal finish contributes to lowering the production cost. The tool is built so that a regular broom stick can be screwed in and used as a handle. This removes the cost of the handle and replaces it with an easily attainable product. The possibility of self-adjustment of the handle length is preserved for the user."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "youtubeId": "-TxAkSvusCM",
          "start": null
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "images": [
