  "about": {
    "slug": "about",
    "title": "About",
    "modules": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "images": [
          {
            "url": "/images/b2e36614-cfd5-4cb6-9887-76fbcbab6c04_rw_1920.jpg",
            "ratio": 150
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "28-year-old graduate of the Holon Institute of Technology’s Industrial Design Department. For the past three years, I have worked as a freelance designer with dozens of different clients on a variety of projects, including parametric design for manufacturing, 3D renders and animations, exhibition planning, sculpture design, and more. I’m fascinated by computational design and spend most of my free time thinking about new solutions and inventions that address different needs and subjects. I tend to find an interesting angle in every project and enjoy collaborating to create great things!"
      }
    ]
  },
